# Staging build output — regenerated on demand via `npm run deploy:staging` in the game
# project, not a canonical deployed record like site/game/ (production) is. Fast-iterating
# test target, not worth versioning every staging deploy.
site-game-staging/
site-neon-drift-staging/

# Editor-local, auto-generated when a multi-root workspace is opened (e.g. this project +
# ~/projects/apps side by side) — not part of the deployable codebase.
*.code-workspace
